# Cursor Rules

Use AGENTS.md as the single source of truth for this repository.
If any local rule conflicts with AGENTS.md, AGENTS.md wins.

Key defaults:

- Prefer MDX for content pages in src/pages.
- Use Astro files for layout/composition concerns.
- Use native CSS layers and tokens (--clr, --ff, --sp), no Tailwind.
- Keep changes minimal and focused.
- The user may prompt in German; prefer responding in German.
- Apply minimal non-invasive changes directly.
- For larger or invasive changes, propose first and ask for confirmation.
